<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco changes bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco changes bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has increased A-960 bunker fuel from Jeddah and Yanbu by $1 a tonne to $97 a tonne with effect July 24, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A-888 bunker diesel from the two ports is $3 a tonne higher at $183 while A-888 from Ras Tanura and Dammam is $2 a tonne lower at $194. A-960 from the Gulf ports is unchanged at $101.</p>
</text>
